Sectoare de activitate: Servicii IT și consultanță IT și Dezvoltare de software personalizat pentru sisteme IT
EOS IT Services SRL is a Romania-based technology company and part of the international EOS Group, one of Europe’s leading providers of financial and debt management services and a member of the Otto Group. Headquartered in Bucharest, the company delivers enterprise software development, IT systems design, and digital transformation solutions that support EOS operations across multiple international markets.
 As a strategic technology hub within the group, EOS IT Services focuses on building scalable, secure, and innovative digital solutions that improve operational efficiency, automate business processes, and enhance customer experience. The company combines technical expertise with international standards, contributing to the continuous modernization of financial services through technology, collaboration, and innovation.
 About the job 
 We are looking for a skilled FullStack Developer to join our team! If you’re passionate about building mission-critical applications and thrive in dynamic, fast-paced environments, we want to meet you!
 Required skills: 
Proven hands-on Software Development experience;
Agile/Scrum development practices and principles focusing on writing high-performance, clean, quality code;
Java 17+, Spring Boot 3.x, JPA / Hibernate, Oracle DB;
Angular 17+, Typescript, Bootstrap, Angular Material;
ActiveMQ, JMS;
Docker, AWS experience is a plus;
Microservices architecture, REST APIs, SOAP;
Good communication skills and client-oriented attitude;
Pro-active problem-solving skills, analytical mind and positive attitude;
Results oriented and focused on meeting delivery timelines;
Fast learner;
Availability to travel abroad occasionally, if needed;
Fluency in English is a must.
 Nice to have skills: 
BS/MS degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field;
Experience in the financial services domain;
Experience with Kafka;
DevOps experience;
Experience with monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana.
 Responsibilities: 
Develop features for microservice applications;
Write well designed, testable, clean, quality code;
Ensure designs are following specifications;
Support continuous improvement by recommending alternatives technologies and presenting these for architectural review;
Contribute to all phases of the development and maintenance lifecycle;
Chip in towards the design solutions that can sustain our high computation and low latency business requirements;
Help drive our agile philosophy;
Work alongside database, business analysis and product owners to drive the right solution.
 What We Offer: 
Flexible working hours;
Meal tickets;
Medical insurance subscription;
21 days holiday per year;
1 day of additional leave for each year in the company;
1 day of additional leave for your birthday;
In-house and team events outside the company’s headquarters;
Hackathon, Wall of Fame (international INOVATION competition within EOS Group);
Preferred offers from mobile providers;
Annual bonus based on performance;
Gift tickets for special occasions: Christmas/Easter/Children’s Day;
Possibility to work remote 2 days a week;
Permanent working contract;
Access to learning platforms Pluralsight, Udemy .
 If you’re ready to take on new challenges and be part of an innovative team, apply today!
